# Drizzle migrations AND metadata ARE committed to the repository per
# Contract 01 §Migration Contract ("migrations are committed to the repo;
# migration history is immutable after application to a shared
# environment"). Drizzle-Kit's meta/ directory contains the snapshot and
# journal that future `drizzle-kit generate` runs diff against; without
# them, the next generate cannot detect what already migrated and would
# produce duplicate/incorrect migrations. Both SQL and meta are tracked.

